menu "RoboHub Sonoff S60TPF (Tasmota)"

config RH_DEV_SONOFF_S60TPF
    bool "Sonoff S60TPF reflashed with Tasmota"
    select RH_JSON
    select RH_MQTT
    default n
    help
      A Sonoff S60TPF Wi-Fi plug reflashed with Tasmota (tasmota32c3), as a
      switch and power meter over MQTT. Stock eWeLink firmware is not
      supported.

endmenu
